ne;min-width:fit-content;">Reclassifications</span></p><p style="text-indent:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Certain prior period amounts reported have been reclassified to conform with current year presentation.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_c99d87c8-d1d6-4599-92e2-00abb79cef57" contextRef="C_07500b7e-f159-4fbf-9100-bec50b2e4b87" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementPolicyPolicyTextBlock" escape="true"><p style="text-indent:2.267%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Fair Value Measurement</span></p><p style="text-indent:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The carrying amounts reported in the Company&#8217;s consolidated balance sheets for Cash and Cash Equivalents, Restricted Cash, Accounts Receivable, </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Accounts Payable and Other Liabilities approximated fair value because of their short-term maturities.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
